'''Parasol Base''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] found in [[Summer Break Cats#Unprecedented Forecasts|Unprecedented Forecasts]]. It was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Parasol Base
|image = E 738.png
|appearance = [[Summer Break Cats Castaway#Unprecedented Forecasts|Unprecedented Forecasts]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
This animated mimics the appearance of a regular base but functions similarly to a [[Sunrise Doge]] with superior range and a slightly faster attack cycle.

==Strategy==
Parasol Base is a nuisance at best, since it deals negligible damage and its Freeze duration is still very short, though players need to be cautious when using cats with the [[Survive]] ability if said units manage to survive a lethal strike, as anything that touches them will finish them off. Just like Sunrise Doge, using cats with [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]] helps, and in some cases fighting outside of its range may still be an option, despite its extreme reach.

